HST Office default configuration for the LibreOffice 26.8.1.1 based suite.

- Tabbed (NotebookBar, ribbon-like) UI active by default in Writer, Calc and
  Impress (ToolbarMode Applications/<app>/Active = notebookbar.ui, the value
  sfx2/source/notebookbar/SfxNotebookBar.cxx compares with each mode's
  CommandArg). Users can still switch via View > User Interface.
- Product-facing help/feedback/donation/release-notes/credits URLs point to
  HST (hasontech.vn, github.com/haduyson/hst-office) instead of TDF services
  (menu items carry utm_medium=menu; the Help target is in hst-debrand.patch).
- No upstream "What's New" infobar/dialog (Setup/Product WhatsNew*=false).
- Writer default fonts Times New Roman (Decree 30/2020 Phụ lục I, I.4); when
  the font is absent fontconfig substitutes metric-compatible Liberation Serif.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-defaults.py on a fresh profile.
